2. **Headline block (top):** headline (copy §4) in the display face, two lines allowed; one-line subhead beneath in muted secondary text.
3. **The third-coordinate chip (thin band under the subhead):** `3.0 = WHICH LEVERS (mechanism) · 3.1 = WHICH COMPOUNDS (family) · 3.2 = WHEN & HOW MUCH (the calendar)` — closes the Optimize arc and primes the timeline as the payoff map.
4. **THE YEAR AXIS (the hero spine — one bold horizontal rail across the full width, lower-middle):** labelled months/quarters. Everything pins to this one axis. Two stacked lanes ride it:
