10. **Footer — the operating-system bridge (one-line legend tying forward to Part 5):** `Drug calendar on top · food calendar underneath · protection stack always-on (Part 4) · the full week-by-week assembly → Part 5.1.` · the trace key (`trace must stay in the gate band · red = breached the ceiling`) · series mark `Fit — Performance Enhancement`.

